c_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQReTO5pQyH5TKG4sCbMpCmbnr0mZTyus7KkI3PEvZfRTQ&oe=6AEB458B"}, "display_name": "POLYBLOCS", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Research-Creation Project: The Polyblocs construction game, integrated into a virtual environment, enables the rapid creation of prototypes, offering a playful and participatory way to shape architectural concepts. The Polyblocs tool provides practitioners with a space for freedom and agency often lacking in conventional architectural design solutions, fostering spontaneous expression in the previsualization process.\n\n", "short_description": "The Polyblocs construction game, integrated into a virtual environment, enables rapid prototyping, offering a playful, participatory approach to architectural design while fostering freedom and spontaneity in previsualization.\n\n\n"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "cov1.png", "id": "2351174138582301", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974759_2351174141915634_2969451169120856586_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=65-Dzlzy42EQ7kNvwH0phNq&_nc_oc=AdoqXI6jj_fs2_RjHEU4c012mLOy5dRyj_rhoORNWGJBPkk9U27h1chHo0b6dPEnalM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTG67JSGD6l90obFI_YZmc488qNTi8JD0CsGObYdM9aFg&oe=6AEB3909"}, {"file_name": "cov4.png", "id": "1531289950891358", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75485579_1531289954224691_4417623240716955788_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oboVG8gIczUQ7kNvwEYFYwe&_nc_oc=AdrvqC22E-q5OUB3_jUeB5F9ERzbXUfoCC8i8lKXFqUFeOSKBosETUpqO8H3p33NZCI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQgrDxK1MwTgQIOrJ3RRPXs8jwmVxm-reec4MzUFJ8IsQ&oe=6AEB373D"}, {"file_name": "banner pb 1440 1440 v2.png", "id": "1498865307473211", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.577